ECAI.Caf\u00e9 Summer Gathering\" />\n                    \n                </a>\n                \n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <a class=\"title-link\" href=\"/news/110\">\n                    Looking Back at the SECAI.Caf\u00e9 Summer Semester Program\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"pb-3\">\n            <div style=\"position: relative;\">\n                <a href=\"/news/109\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n                    \n                        <img width=\"320\" height=\"180\"\n                            src=\"/media/cache/2f/4c/2f4cbfe3a0442c379b86bc38a87e6104.jpg\"\n                            alt=\"Moritz Hehl auf der ICML 2026 in Seoul, Korea\" />\n                    \n                </a>\n                \n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <a class=\"title-link\" href=\"/news/109\">\n                    Moritz Hehl Presents a Spotlight Paper at ICML in Seoul\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n    </div>\n</div>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- footer -->\n                <footer class=\"footer\">\n            <div class=\"footer-secai\">\n                <div class=\"container d-flex flex-column flex-md-row justify-content-start py-3\">\n                    <div class=\"pe-0 pe-md-5 py-3 py-md-0\">\n                        <h2>A joint project of</h2>\n                        <ul style=\"list-style-type:none\">\n                            <li style=\"padding: 10px; padding-left: 15px; \">\n                                <a href=\"https://tu-dresden.de/?set_language=en\">\n                                    <img style=\"height: 47px; \" src=\"/media/frontend/Logo_TU_Dresden_white.svg\" alt=\"TU Dresden\">\n                                </a>\n                            </li>\n                            <li style=\"padding: 10px; \">\n                                <a hre